#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect the result {#inspect-the-result}"
msgstr "Inspecter le résultat {#inspect-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result dictionary contains four top-level fields:\n"
msgstr "Le dictionnaire de résultat contient quatre champs de premier niveau :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`solution` is the complete variable assignment, keyed by `x_i`, where _i_ is the variable index (for example, `x_17`). In this tutorial, the variable index is the node label.\n"
msgstr "`solution` est l'affectation complète des variables, indexée par `x_i`, où _i_ est l'indice de la variable (par exemple, `x_17`). Dans ce tutoriel, l'indice de la variable est l'étiquette du nœud.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`objective_value` is the objective of that assignment evaluated on the submitted dictionary, that is, on the minimization QUBO.\n"
msgstr "`objective_value` est l'objectif de cette affectation évalué sur le dictionnaire soumis, c'est-à-dire sur le QUBO de minimisation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`feasible` refers only to the variable domain, because the dictionary has no constraints.\n"
msgstr "`feasible` ne concerne que le domaine des variables, car le dictionnaire n'a pas de contraintes.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`metadata` contains `solver_info` and `resource_usage`. `solver_info` records the effective `seed` of the run. If the classical local search ran, `solver_info` also records the rounded assignment from before that refinement in `solution_before_postprocessing`.\n"
msgstr "`metadata` contient `solver_info` et `resource_usage`. `solver_info` enregistre la `seed` effective de l'exécution. Si la recherche locale classique a été exécutée, `solver_info` enregistre aussi l'affectation arrondie d'avant cet affinage dans `solution_before_postprocessing`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the solution to the graph {#map-the-solution-to-the-graph}"
msgstr "Associer la solution au graphe {#map-the-solution-to-the-graph}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect the returned values in the order of the variable indices, and map them back to the variables of the original problem with `interpret()`. The selected nodes are the variables with the value 1, and `is_feasible()` checks the assignment against the edge constraints of the original problem.\n"
msgstr "Rassemble les valeurs renvoyées dans l'ordre des indices de variables, puis réassocie-les aux variables du problème d'origine avec `interpret()`. Les nœuds sélectionnés sont les variables de valeur 1, et `is_feasible()` vérifie l'affectation par rapport aux contraintes d'arête du problème d'origine.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
